; The ship you come in on, tied up along the pier, with her near rail and the gangplank down onto the
; pier, the bollards her lines go to, and the boats. The ship and her rail have to stay a tile apart,
; one above the other, since the arrival walks you off by where they are.
prop ship 27.5 26.5
prop gangplank 27.5 27.5
prop bollard 21.5 27
prop bollard 34 27
prop rowboat 10 20
prop rowboat 24 31
prop rowboat 65 20.5

; Along the front of the boardwalk, and the harbour bell at the top of the jetty, kept clear of the
; way up it from the ship.
prop bollard 3 17.8
prop bollard 15 17.8
prop bollard 28 17.8
prop bollard 34 17.8
prop bollard 42 17.8
prop bollard 50 17.8
prop bollard 59 17.8
prop bollard 63.5 17.8
prop bollard 70 17.8
