; What the two of you say as you go, and what the townsfolk say to each other. The Red Gulls up
; ahead as you come off the jetty; after them, the mess the fight left, the fish, the fishwives
; talking it over, the warehouses, the gulls on the landing stage and the boardwalk; the sailors in
; from the east; and the city, just before the road up to it.
trigger bark-docks-gulls-ahead 21 13 w=3 h=5 bark=docks-gulls-ahead
trigger bark-docks-boardwalk 10 14 w=4 h=4 bark=docks-boardwalk
trigger bark-docks-boardwalk-grell 10 14 w=4 h=4 bark=docks-boardwalk-grell
